antly in battle with  blink remarking that david is what you  would get if you rolled up professor x  magneto and the phoenix force all into  one entity which should give you a good  idea of how ridiculously powerful this  guy is now after the sentinels are  defeated david announces that they were  just a symptom of the earth's real  problem which is humans he then takes  over blink's mind and forces her to use  her powers to murder people by  teleporting them in half for two solid  days david's killing spree was then put  to an end when sabertooth took him by  surprise and ripped his heart from his  chest now david would eventually  resurrect himself but would not retain  any of his memories or his powers but in  the brief time he was around david  richards was extremely powerful as he  was born of two omega-level mutants now  like his mother david possesses  incredibly strong telepathic and  telekinetic abilities not only can he  read minds but he can take control of  the minds of others and force them to  act in accordance with his will and  against their own as we saw when he  forced blink to murder a bunch of people  he also possesses the ability to absorb  the powers of others and mimic whatever  powers they may possess and even amp  them up to higher levels for instance  blink was able to exceed the limitations  of her teleportation ability when david  was in control of her mind but what  really sets david apart is that he seems  to be able to manifest the phoenix force  at will now the phoenix force is one of  the most powerful forces in the marvel  universe and is the embodiment of all  life that has ever currently does or  will ever exist across the omniverse so  typically we've seen the phoenix force  take over a host such as jean grey or  rachel summers and basically use the  host to do some ridiculously powerful  things and in some cases like with jean  grey the phoenix force can actually  corrupt the person that is chosen as its  host regardless the fact that david  richards is able to summon the phoenix  force seemingly at will and without  having to serve as its host and the fact  that he is described as being professor  x magneto and the phoenix force all  rolled into one and it's not hard to  determine that he is way beyond omega  level granted we don't see minnie feetzy  pulls off because he's not around very  long in the comics all we really see is  him taking out 84 sentinels at once but  when we evaluate his potential we know  that he's capable of a whole lot more  and the fact that he is the son of  franklin richards who is probably one of  the most powerful reality warpers in all  of marvel comics suggests that maybe he  has reality warping abilities but we  haven't really been able to find any  concrete examples of him being able to  alter reality but yeah that's basically  david richards right we don't really see  him pop up outside of like that one  reality but it would be interesting to  see him at the height of his power so  with that being said guys we're gonna  bring this to an end if there are any  characters you want to see post comments  down below and i will catch you all  later  peace
 

